crateyard: a toy package registry
commands (ACTOR acts; VIEWER reads, '-' for anonymous):
  audit [n=N]
  check
  clock advance DURATION
  clock set T
  clock show
  dependents VIEWER PACKAGE
  deprecate ACTOR PACKAGE VERSION [message=TEXT]
  export audit tsv|csv
  fetch VIEWER PACKAGE [REQUIREMENT|@TAG]
  help [COMMAND]
  info VIEWER PACKAGE
  invites ACTOR PACKAGE
  lock VIEWER NAME PACKAGE@REQUIREMENT...
  outdated VIEWER LOCKNAME
  owner accept ACTOR PACKAGE
  owner invite ACTOR PACKAGE USER [role=ROLE] [ttl=DURATION]
  owner remove ACTOR PACKAGE USER
  package delete ACTOR PACKAGE
  prune ACTOR PACKAGE
  publish ACTOR PACKAGE VERSION [size=SIZE] [deps=LIST] [embargo=DURATION] [visibility=public|private]
  quota USER
  quota set ACTOR USER KIB
  resolve VIEWER PACKAGE REQUIREMENT
  roles VIEWER PACKAGE
  search VIEWER TEXT
  tag add ACTOR PACKAGE TAG VERSION
  tag rm ACTOR PACKAGE TAG
  tags VIEWER PACKAGE
  top VIEWER downloads|releases|dependents|size [n=N]
  unpublish ACTOR PACKAGE VERSION
  unyank ACTOR PACKAGE VERSION
  user add NAME [admin]
  user disable ACTOR NAME
  user enable ACTOR NAME
  user remove ACTOR NAME
  user show NAME
  visibility ACTOR PACKAGE public|private
  yank ACTOR PACKAGE VERSION [reason=TEXT]
usage: publish ACTOR PACKAGE VERSION [size=SIZE] [deps=LIST] [embargo=DURATION] [visibility=public|private]
usage: owner invite ACTOR PACKAGE USER [role=ROLE] [ttl=DURATION]
